Now menu rewrite. Current showItemMenu block. Let's replace from `private showItemMenu` to before `private addMenuButton`, and update addMenuButton. New:

```
private showItemMenu(uid,isBag) {
  this.closeMenu();
  if(!this.viewNode) return;
  ... def lookup
  const actions: {text,cb}[] = [];
  if(isBag){
    if(def.edible) actions.push({吃掉, ...eat});
    actions.push({拿出, moveToFloor});
  } else {
    actions.push({放入背包, ()=>{const r=this.autoPlaceToBag(uid); if(r.ok){close; renderFloor; renderBag; onChanged; Fx...} else Fx.floatText(...,'背包满了')}});
    if(def.edible) actions.push({吃掉,...});
    actions.push({扔掉,...});
    if(def.cells===2) actions.push({旋转?...});
  }
  const panelW=280, panelH=Math.max(200, 96+actions.length*56);
  const menu=uiNode('item_menu'); parent viewNode; ut 720x1280? menu content size 720x1280 to cover; position 0.
  const dim=uiNode('dim'); parent menu; ut 720x1280; g rect; on touch start close.
  const panel=uiNode('panel'); parent menu; ut panelW,panelH; g roundRect; position(0,40).
  title...
  y=panelH/2-96; for actions create button 200x44 at (0,y); y-=56;
  menu.setSiblingIndex...
}
```
But adding `menu` with size 720x1280 and dim child: dim also 720x1280; menu at 0. The panel at (0,40). Dim listener closes menu on any touch; panel children buttons receive touches and may also bubble to dim? Touch events bubble up; dim is a sibling of panel, not parent, so dim won't receive touches on panel (hit test only nodes under touch; dim is behind panel but Cocos hit tests all? Touch dispatch picks topmost node; dim is earlier sibling behind panel, so panel/button gets it, not dim). Good. Touches outside panel hit dim → close.
- Add panel background; buttons parent panel.
- `menu.setSiblingIndex(viewNode.children.length-1)`.

Action callbacks:
- eat: `game.eat(uid); close; renderFloor; renderBag; onChanged`.
- moveToFloor: `game.moveToFloor(uid)`, etc.
- discard: `game.discard(uid)`, renderFloor, onChanged.
- rotate: toggle map, close, renderFloor.
- 放入背包: autoPlace; if ok close, renderFloor, renderBag, onChanged, Fx; else Fx '背包满了'.

Need to ensure after autoPlace, the floor node is re-rendered.

`addMenuButton` signature parent,text,pos,cb; use Art.makeButton(text,200,44,cb,20).

Title font 24, panel top.

Dim draw: `g.rect(-360,-640,720,1280)` with menu at 0.

Also `menu` needs UITransform for hit? Children have; menu itself not hit. Fine.

Let's replace.

