content.text:
We'll replace findEdibleUid with bag-specific or add new. Since only cat uses, change implementation to bag-only and rename `findBagEdibleUid`. But maybe other code? Only one call. Do:
```
private findBagEdibleUid(): number | null {
 for (const item of this.bag) { def edible return uid; }
 return null;
}
```
Then cat:
```
if (optionIndex===0) {
 const uid=this.findBagEdibleUid();
 if (uid!=null) {
   const idx=this.bag.findIndex(p=>p.uid===uid);
   if (idx>=0) this.bag.splice(idx,1);
   this.catLuck=...
   this.lastEventNotice='';
 } else {
   this.lastEventNotice='包里没吃的';
 }
}
```
No hunger/stamina change. Note if food item has scratch value etc; removing okay.
- "只从背包移除一份食物" exactly.
- If multiple edible items, removes first.
- `catLuck` set only if fed.
- `lastEventNotice` clear at top of resolveEvent for all events; then cat sets on failure.

Add field:
```
public lastEventNotice: string;
```
constructor `this.lastEventNotice='';` startGame same.
`resolveEvent` start: `this.lastEventNotice='';`.
Maybe UI after resolve reads.

Implement.

